{"id":"8aa5997eb451f824","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-quantifier-rank.md","title":"量化秩","display":"df-quantifier-rank — 量化秩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-quantifier-rank","aliases":["28-df-quantifier-rank"],"display":"df-quantifier-rank — 量化秩","depends_on":["[[28-df-formula]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-quantifier-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-quantifier-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-rank — 量化秩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-quantifier-rank-—-量化秩-$\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)$\">df-quantifier-rank — 量化秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a> 的一阶语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。以下按有限公式树结构递归。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (量化秩函数的类型)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\\\\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\max(\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi),\\mathrm{qr}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\\\\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi)+1&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi\\;\\lor\\;\\varphi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\\\\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\max(\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi),\\mathrm{qr}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\\\\\mathrm{qr}(\\psi)+1&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi\\;\\lor\\;\\varphi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 公式中量词嵌套的最大深度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录一阶语法与语义接口上的自足支撑定义；不将本地模型论包装冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-quantifier-rank-—-量化秩-$\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)$","text":"df-quantifier-rank — 量化秩 $\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target